The question asks for RAN5 specs modified by CRs per company. "RAN5" ownership is defined by the specification_primary_inventory (R5 primary code), which is source data — not a graph fact. The graph has no property indicating RAN5 ownership, and I cannot treat the source listing as proof of graph answers or filter graph specs by it reliably as a native field.

However, the graph does support "company modifies spec via CR": Company —rel_SUBMITTED_BY← CR —rel_MODIFIES→ Spec. But restricting to "RAN5 specs" requires the R5 ownership determination, which isn't a graph-queryable property.

